---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /precast-concrete-molds/index.html
pageType: precast-moulds
title: Precast Concrete Moulds & Formwork | Realjet
seoTitle: Precast Concrete Moulds & Steel Formwork Manufacturer | Realjet
description: Project-specific steel moulds and formwork for precast bridge, building, tunnel, municipal, marine, retaining-wall and special concrete components.
canonical: https://realjetech.com/precast-concrete-molds/
socialImage: https://realjetech.com/images/products/precast-moulds/precast-concrete-moulds-hero.webp
robots: index, follow
---
<article class="moulds-landing">
  <section class="moulds-hero">
    <img class="moulds-hero-background" src="/images/products/precast-moulds/precast-concrete-moulds-hero.webp" data-random-hero data-hero-sources="/images/products/precast-moulds/precast-concrete-moulds-hero.webp|/images/products/precast-moulds/precast-concrete-moulds-hero-2.webp|/images/products/precast-moulds/precast-concrete-moulds-hero-3.webp" alt="" width="1530" height="690" aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" />
    <div class="container moulds-hero-shell">
      <div class="moulds-hero-grid">
        <div class="moulds-hero-copy">
          <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Precast Concrete Moulds</span></nav>
          <span class="eyebrow">Project-Specific Steel Mould Systems</span>
          <h1>Precast Concrete Moulds &amp; Formwork</h1>
          <p>Project-specific steel mould systems engineered around component geometry, casting sequence, production target and factory or casting-yard conditions.</p>
          <div class="moulds-hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="#mould-catalogue" data-mould-cta="explore_products">Explore Mould Types <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
            <button class="button button-outline" type="button" data-universal-enquiry data-enquiry-keyword="Precast concrete moulds enquiry">Enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          </div>
          <ul class="moulds-proof-list" aria-label="Planning basis">
            <li>Factory or casting-yard use</li>
            <li>Mechanical or hydraulic operation</li>
            <li>Made to approved drawings</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="mould-scenario-nav" aria-label="Application scenarios">
        <div>
          {% for category in precastMouldCatalog.categories | limit(5) %}<a href="#{{ category.slug }}" data-mould-category="{{ category.slug }}">{{ category.name }}</a>{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="mould-catalogue" class="mould-catalogue" aria-labelledby="mould-catalogue-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading mould-catalogue-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Product Catalogue</span><h2 id="mould-catalogue-title">Precast mould systems by application</h2><p>Published product pages show confirmed scope and available visual evidence. Additional shapes are reviewed through custom mould engineering.</p></div>
      {% for category in precastMouldCatalog.categories %}
      {% set categoryProducts = collections.publishedMouldProducts | mouldProductsForCategory(category.slug) %}
      {% if categoryProducts.length %}
      <section class="mould-category-products" id="{{ category.slug }}" aria-labelledby="{{ category.slug }}-title">
        <div class="mould-category-products-heading"><h3 id="{{ category.slug }}-title"><a href="/precast-concrete-molds/{{ category.slug }}/">{{ category.name }}</a></h3></div>
        <div class="mould-products-carousel">
          <button class="mould-carousel-control mould-carousel-control-left" type="button" data-mould-carousel-direction="-1" aria-label="View previous {{ category.name }} products"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span></button>
          <div class="mould-products-grid{% if category.slug == 'bridge-transportation-moulds' %} mould-products-grid-3x2{% endif %}" style="--mould-columns: {{ categoryProducts.length }}">{% for mouldProduct in categoryProducts %}{% include "components/mould-product-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}</div>
          <button class="mould-carousel-control mould-carousel-control-right" type="button" data-mould-carousel-direction="1" aria-label="View next {{ category.name }} products"><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        </div>
      </section>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mould-quality" aria-labelledby="mould-quality-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="moulds-section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Manufacturing Evidence</span><h2 id="mould-quality-title">Make quality visible in the workshop</h2></div><p>Project acceptance remains subject to the approved drawings, inspection plan and agreed delivery scope.</p></div>
      <div class="mould-quality-grid">
        <article><img src="/images/uploads/plate-cutting.webp" alt="Steel plate cutting in the Realjet manufacturing workshop" width="550" height="309" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><strong>Material preparation</strong><span>Plate cutting and part identification follow the released manufacturing drawings.</span></div></article>
        <article><img src="/images/uploads/robotic-welding.webp" alt="Robotic welding equipment in the Realjet manufacturing workshop" width="760" height="427" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><strong>Welding and fabrication</strong><span>Support frames, contact surfaces, joints and locking positions are built for the approved mould concept.</span></div></article>
        <article><img src="/images/uploads/machining.webp" alt="Machining operation at the Realjet manufacturing facility" width="760" height="427" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><strong>Machined interfaces</strong><span>Critical interfaces are machined where the project design and inspection plan require them.</span></div></article>
        <article><img src="/images/uploads/quality-inspection.webp" alt="Realjet quality inspector checking a manufactured steel component" width="760" height="427" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><strong>Trial assembly and inspection</strong><span>Fit-up, movement and key dimensions are checked against the agreed inspection basis.</span></div></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mould-capability" aria-labelledby="mould-capability-title">
    <div class="container mould-capability-layout">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">Complete Project Capability</span><h2 id="mould-capability-title">More than a standalone steel mould</h2><p>When included in the agreed project scope, Realjet can connect mould engineering with production layout and the equipment interfaces required around casting, curing, handling and transfer.</p></div>
      <ul><li>Single moulds or coordinated mould sets</li><li>Factory and casting-yard layout interfaces</li><li>Concrete placing, curing and transfer integration</li><li>Hydraulic power and control options</li><li>Trial assembly and inspection</li><li>Installation and commissioning support as agreed</li></ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="mould-enquiry" class="mould-enquiry mould-enquiry-cta" aria-labelledby="mould-enquiry-title">
    <div class="container mould-enquiry-shell">
      <div class="mould-enquiry-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Project Enquiry</span><h2 id="mould-enquiry-title">Tell us the component type and project requirements.</h2><p>Use the Message field to outline the component, main dimensions, target output and whether drawings are available. Realjet will request detailed files through an appropriate follow-up channel.</p></div>
      <button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-universal-enquiry data-enquiry-keyword="Precast concrete moulds general enquiry">Start Your Mould Project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>

